  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1788362285_9942244_3db827c9a5ec32a58d9ffdc7ba437371.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">• About our brand and products:<br>• What makes us different:<br>• How affiliates can earn:<br>• How to promote us:<br>• Other information:</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><br></span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">About our brand and products:</span></h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&amp;LIVY is an intention-based jewelry brand. Designed and manufactured in Rhode Island, &amp;LIVY creates meaningful, wearable pieces that celebrate connection, self-expression, and the intentions we carry with us.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Our expandable product offerings, such as our signature POSY expandable bangles and expandable necklaces, are designed to be layered and worn every day.</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">What makes us different:</span></h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&amp;LIVY's intention-based philosophy allows us to create meaningful jewelry. Every piece is infused with positive energy and designed to tell a story, mark a moment, or serve as a personal reminder.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">&amp;LIVY is proudly rooted in Rhode Island and brings decades of jewelry-industry experience to a new generation of meaningful jewelry.</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">How affiliates can earn:</span></h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Affiliates earn commission on qualifying sales generated through their unique affiliate link or code. The more you share &amp;LIVY with your audience, the more you can earn.</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">How to promote us:</span></h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We encourage affiliates to make &amp;LIVY part of their authentic lifestyle and storytelling. Some ideas include:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Unboxings &amp; try-ons:</strong> Showcase functionality by demonstrating the jewelry and how the pieces look worn.</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Storytelling content:</strong> Share what a particular sentiment means to you or someone in your life.</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Layering/styling:</strong> Show how POSYs and Intention Chains can be stacked and layered.</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>GRWM &amp; lifestyle content:</strong> Incorporate &amp;LIVY naturally into everyday outfits and routines.</li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Milestone moments: </strong>Birthdays, anniversaries, graduations, new beginnings, friendship, and other meaningful occasions.</li></ul><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Authentic, personal storytelling performs best, especially when the creator shares why a particular piece or sentiment resonates with them.</span></p><h3><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Other information:</span></h3><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Join the &amp;LIVY family if you love to create and love meaningful jewelry.</span></p></div></div>",
